WEBVTT

00:01:58.788 --> 00:02:00.204
and back home in New York,

00:02:00.204 --> 00:02:04.329
I used a wheelchair for four years,
all through college.

00:02:05.038 --> 00:02:07.954
College ended and I returned
to Jerusalem for a year.

00:02:08.413 --> 00:02:11.121
There, I rose from my chair for good,

00:02:11.121 --> 00:02:14.204
I leaned on my cane, and I looked back,

00:02:14.246 --> 00:02:17.454
finding all, from my
fellow passengers in the bus

00:02:17.496 --> 00:02:19.579
to photographs of the crash.

00:02:20.163 --> 00:02:22.663
And when I saw this photograph --

00:02:24.704 --> 00:02:27.413
I didn't see a bloody and unmoving body.

00:02:27.871 --> 00:02:31.538
I saw the healthy bulk of a left deltoid,